ll,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3IcHCFYoCA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3YcHCFgoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3IcHCFcoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3YcHCFooAA"],[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3YcHCFsoAQ"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwiIvYH58dSWAxX8jq8BHQF5LFwQ3IcHCFkoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一幸拉麵大勇店\n20260425週六中午11:42初訪雨天\n\n候位方式：門口登記候位\n來客狀況：店內三人\n點餐方式：掃碼\n支付方式：掃碼完櫃檯現金支付。\n發票載具：無。\n洗手間：有，很乾淨。有馬桶、小便斗、擦手紙、感應式垃圾桶。\n餐具：自取、用餐後自行回收。\n飲用水：櫃檯自取；有冰水與柚子茶。\n人員配置：兩人。\n座位配置：前區有窗邊吧台三個位子，雙人桌兩張。後區有四人桌兩張。\n置物空間：置物籃自取。\n\n當日選擇餐點：\n濃厚醬油特盛270\n泡系柚子鹽特盛265\n\n湯：泡系柚子鹽雞白湯有模有樣，這個價位很ok。醬油濃厚反而不如雞白湯濃厚，只是比較鹹、比較油。個人比較喜歡雞白湯。\n麵：可以加半碗/一碗麵或飯。\n配料：特盛是四種肉：松阪豬、梅花豬、柚香雞胸、嫩肩牛。整顆溏心蛋。木耳、海苔、洋蔥碎。\n佐料：隨桌有蒜泥、辣粉、七味粉。都不會太辣，可以加！\n\n心得備注：\n發現鹿鳴堂二郎系拉麵的老闆在這邊工作。老闆果然還是愛拉麵的，問了才發現原來老闆以前就是一幸拉麵出身的。老闆說鹿鳴堂遇到一些無法解決的問題，只好關店。",null,[0,29]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5447980287902618629/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhqZUUwelduSlpiRW8xVjBSb1ptVllhRXhqVnpsVVlsaEdhRTFZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5447980287902618629/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhqZUUwelduSlpiRW8xVjBSb1ptVllhRXhqVnpsVVlsaEdhRTFZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5447980287902618629/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhqZUUwelduSlpiRW8xVjBSb1ptVllhRXhqVnpsVVlsaEdhRTFZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5447980287902618629/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZ